{
  "an10.96:0.1": "Numbered Discourses 10.96 ",
  "an10.96:0.2": "10. With Upāli ",
  "an10.96:0.3": "With Kokanada ",
  "an10.96:1.1": "At one time Venerable Ānanda was staying near Rājagaha in the Hot Springs Monastery. ",
  "an10.96:1.2": "Then Ānanda rose at the crack of dawn and went to the hot springs to bathe. ",
  "an10.96:1.3": "When he had bathed and emerged from the water he stood in one robe drying his limbs. ",
  "an10.96:1.4": "The wanderer Kokanada also rose at the crack of dawn and went to the hot springs to bathe. ",
  "an10.96:2.1": "He saw Ānanda coming off in the distance ",
  "an10.96:2.2": "and said to him, ",
  "an10.96:2.3": "“Who’s here, reverend?” ",
  "an10.96:2.4": "“I’m a mendicant, reverend.” ",
  "an10.96:3.1": "“Of which mendicants?” ",
  "an10.96:3.2": "“Of the ascetics who follow the Sakyan.” ",
  "an10.96:4.1": "“I’d like to ask the venerable about a certain point, if you’d take the time to answer.” ",
  "an10.96:4.2": "“Ask, reverend. When I’ve heard it I’ll know.” ",
  "an10.96:5.1": "“Is this your view: ‘The cosmos is eternal. This is the only truth, anything else is futile’?” ",
  "an10.96:5.2": "“That’s not my view, reverend.” ",
  "an10.96:5.3": "",
  "an10.96:6.1": "“Then is this your view: ‘The cosmos is not eternal. This is the only truth, anything else is futile’?” ",
  "an10.96:6.2": "“That’s not my view, reverend.” ",
  "an10.96:6.3": "",
  "an10.96:7.1": "“Then is this your view: ‘The cosmos